{"id":913288,"title":"12｜让AI实现广度联网搜索","content":"本节课主要介绍了如何让AI实现广度联网搜索，包括回顾AI联网搜索架构、介绍SearXNG搜索引擎以及让AI通过关键字进行搜索的方法。首先，AI联网搜索架构基于RAG原理，当用户提问时，大模型先调用搜索引擎获取信息再作答，以突破训练数据集局限性并提高准确性。接着介绍了SearXNG，这是一款集成多个搜索引擎的代理工具，能够同时向多个搜索引擎发送请求，从而提供更丰富的搜索结果。部署SearXNG非常简单，可通过Docker命令在服务器上运行。最后，课程展示了如何编写代码使AI像人类一样通过关键字进行多轮搜索。使用LangChain和预定义的ReAct Agent，结合精心设计的提示词，可以指导AI逐步拆分问题并动态调整关键词组合，最终生成详细的报告。整个过程强调了提示词的重要性，特别是在引导AI进行渐进式搜索方面。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":404568,"user_name":"树","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1045646,"ip_address":"上海","ucode":"8080E671F84C46","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/f4/8e/081c530c.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1767690676,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":147290,"content":"👍","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1943646,"ctime":1768292118,"ip_address":"山东","comment_id":404568,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101074901,"comment_content":"安装SearxNG后，默认仅激活HTML输出格式。要使用API 调用，需要在 settings.yml 文件中添加 json 格式:\n```\nsearch:\n    formats:\n        -html\n        -json 【新增】\n```","like_count":1,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1943646,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1d/a8/5e/791d0f5e.jpg","nickname":"最后的风之子","note":"","ucode":"45D5487480A5D2","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":676806,"discussion_content":"👍","content_length":4,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1768292118,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"山东","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]}]}